{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "tp4-listo-pdyc-greater-events",
    "name": "Greater Events TP4 — Listo para usar",
    "description": "# Greater Events — TP3 + TP4 (todo configurado)\n\n**Importá solo este archivo.** No necesitás environment aparte: todas las variables están en la colección.\n\n## Antes de probar\n\n1. Keycloak en `http://localhost:8080` (realm `unnoba` configurado con `./keycloak/setup-realm.sh`)\n2. API en `http://localhost:8081`\n3. `export KEYCLOAK_CLIENT_SECRET=pdyc-secret-dev` antes de arrancar el backend\n\n## Credenciales\n\n| Rol | Usuario | Password |\n|-----|---------|----------|\n| admin | `tp3-user` | `tp3pass` |\n| user  | `tp4-user` | `tp4pass` |\n\n## Cómo obtener el token (una vez por carpeta autenticada)\n\n1. Abrí la carpeta **2 — End-user** o **3 — Admin**\n2. Pestaña **Authorization** → tipo **OAuth 2.0**\n3. **Get New Access Token** → login con las credenciales de arriba\n4. **Use Token** → ejecutá los requests de esa carpeta\n\n## Flujo recomendado\n\nEjecutá en orden la carpeta **TP4 — Flujo demo completo**.\n\n## Datos de ejemplo (seed)\n\n- Evento `1` = tentative (público devuelve 404)\n- Evento `2` = confirmed (ideal para favoritos/notificaciones)\n- Evento `3` = rescheduled\n- Artista `1` = Los Planetarios (activo)\n- Artista `6` = inactivo",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl", "value": "http://localhost:8081" },
    { "key": "callbackUrl", "value": "https://oauth.pstmn.io/v1/callback" },
    { "key": "keycloakAuthUrl", "value": "http://localhost:8080/realms/unnoba/protocol/openid-connect/auth" },
    { "key": "keycloakTokenUrl", "value": "http://localhost:8080/realms/unnoba/protocol/openid-connect/token" },
    { "key": "keycloakClientId", "value": "pdyc" },
    { "key": "keycloakClientSecret", "value": "pdyc-secret-dev" },
    { "key": "adminUsername", "value": "tp3-user" },
    { "key": "adminPassword", "value": "tp3pass" },
    { "key": "endUserUsername", "value": "tp4-user" },
    { "key": "endUserPassword", "value": "tp4pass" },
    { "key": "eventId", "value": "1" },
    { "key": "eventIdConfirmed", "value": "2" },
    { "key": "eventIdRescheduled", "value": "3" },
    { "key": "eventIdCancelled", "value": "4" },
    { "key": "publicEventId", "value": "2" },
    { "key": "publicEventIdTentative", "value": "1" },
    { "key": "publicArtistId", "value": "1" },
    { "key": "followArtistId", "value": "1" },
    { "key": "favoriteEventId", "value": "2" },
    { "key": "artistId", "value": "3" },
    { "key": "artistIdInLineup", "value": "1" },
    { "key": "artistIdInactive", "value": "6" },
    { "key": "adminUserId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "notificationId", "value": "1" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1 — Públicos (sin token)",
      "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
      "description": "No requieren autenticación. Podés ejecutarlos de inmediato.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Register end user",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
                  "  const j = pm.response.json();",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('registeredUsername', j.username);",
                  "  pm.test('Usuario registrado', () => pm.expect(j.username).to.be.a('string'));",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"demo.user\",\n  \"email\": \"demo.user@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"Secret123!\",\n  \"first_name\": \"Demo\",\n  \"last_name\": \"User\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/register",
            "description": "POST /auth/register — 201. Cambiá username/email si ya existen (409)."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "List active artists",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test('Lista de artistas', () => pm.expect(pm.response.json()).to.be.an('array'));"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/artists"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Artist upcoming events",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/artists/{{publicArtistId}}/events"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "List upcoming events",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/events"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get confirmed event (público OK)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/events/{{publicEventId}}"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get tentative event (debe ser 404)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Tentative no expuesto', () => pm.response.to.have.status(404));"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/events/{{publicEventIdTentative}}",
            "description": "La consigna prohíbe exponer eventos tentative en endpoints públicos."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Admin sin token (debe ser 401)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": ["pm.test('Sin token = 401', () => pm.response.to.have.status(401));"],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/admin/artists"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "2 — End-user (rol user, OAuth2)",
      "auth": {
        "type": "oauth2",
        "oauth2": [
          { "key": "grant_type", "value": "authorization_code", "type": "string" },
          { "key": "callbackUrl", "value": "{{callbackUrl}}", "type": "string" },
          { "key": "authUrl", "value": "{{keycloakAuthUrl}}", "type": "string" },
          { "key": "accessTokenUrl", "value": "{{keycloakTokenUrl}}", "type": "string" },
          { "key": "clientId", "value": "{{keycloakClientId}}", "type": "string" },
          { "key": "clientSecret", "value": "{{keycloakClientSecret}}", "type": "string" },
          { "key": "scope", "value": "openid", "type": "string" },
          { "key": "client_authentication", "value": "body", "type": "string" }
        ]
      },
      "description": "Authorization → Get New Access Token → login **tp4-user / tp4pass** → Use Token",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Following",
          "item": [
            {
              "name": "List following",
              "request": { "method": "GET", "url": "{{baseUrl}}/me/following" }
            },
            {
              "name": "Follow artist",
              "request": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
                "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"artist_id\": {{followArtistId}}\n}" },
                "url": "{{baseUrl}}/me/following"
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "Unfollow artist",
              "request": { "method": "DELETE", "url": "{{baseUrl}}/me/following/{{followArtistId}}" }
            },
            {
              "name": "Upcoming events from followed artists",
              "request": { "method": "GET", "url": "{{baseUrl}}/me/following/events" }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Favorite events",
          "item": [
            {
              "name": "List favorite events",
              "request": { "method": "GET", "url": "{{baseUrl}}/me/favorite-events" }
            },
            {
              "name": "Add favorite event",
              "request": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
                "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"event_id\": {{favoriteEventId}}\n}" },
                "url": "{{baseUrl}}/me/favorite-events"
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "Remove favorite event",
              "request": { "method": "DELETE", "url": "{{baseUrl}}/me/favorite-events/{{favoriteEventId}}" }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Notifications",
          "item": [
            {
              "name": "List notifications",
              "event": [
                {
                  "listen": "test",
                  "script": {
                    "exec": [
                      "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                      "  const data = pm.response.json();",
                      "  if (Array.isArray(data) && data.length > 0) {",
                      "    pm.collectionVariables.set('notificationId', String(data[0].id));",
                      "  }",
                      "}"
                    ],
                    "type": "text/javascript"
                  }
                }
              ],
              "request": { "method": "GET", "url": "{{baseUrl}}/me/notifications" }
            },
            {
              "name": "List unread notifications",
              "request": { "method": "GET", "url": "{{baseUrl}}/me/notifications?unread_only=true" }
            },
            {
              "name": "Mark notification as read",
              "request": { "method": "PUT", "url": "{{baseUrl}}/me/notifications/{{notificationId}}/read" }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "3 — Admin (rol admin, OAuth2)",
      "auth": {
        "type": "oauth2",
        "oauth2": [
          { "key": "grant_type", "value": "authorization_code", "type": "string" },
          { "key": "callbackUrl", "value": "{{callbackUrl}}", "type": "string" },
          { "key": "authUrl", "value": "{{keycloakAuthUrl}}", "type": "string" },
          { "key": "accessTokenUrl", "value": "{{keycloakTokenUrl}}", "type": "string" },
          { "key": "clientId", "value": "{{keycloakClientId}}", "type": "string" },
          { "key": "clientSecret", "value": "{{keycloakClientSecret}}", "type": "string" },
          { "key": "scope", "value": "openid", "type": "string" },
          { "key": "client_authentication", "value": "body", "type": "string" }
        ]
      },
      "description": "Authorization → Get New Access Token → login **tp3-user / tp3pass** → Use Token",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Admin Users (Keycloak)",
          "item": [
            {
              "name": "List admin users",
              "request": { "method": "GET", "url": "{{baseUrl}}/admin/users" }
            },
            {
              "name": "Create admin user",
              "event": [
                {
                  "listen": "test",
                  "script": {
                    "exec": [
                      "if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
                      "  pm.collectionVariables.set('adminUserId', pm.response.json().id);",
                      "}"
                    ],
                    "type": "text/javascript"
                  }
                }
              ],
              "request": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"admin-postman\",\n  \"password\": \"Admin123!\",\n  \"email\": \"admin-postman@example.com\",\n  \"first_name\": \"Admin\",\n  \"last_name\": \"Postman\",\n  \"enabled\": true,\n  \"temporary_password\": false\n}"
                },
                "url": "{{baseUrl}}/admin/users"
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "Get admin user by id",
              "request": { "method": "GET", "url": "{{baseUrl}}/admin/users/{{adminUserId}}" }
            },
            {
              "name": "Delete admin user",
              "request": { "method": "DELETE", "url": "{{baseUrl}}/admin/users/{{adminUserId}}" }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Artists",
          "item": [
            { "name": "List artists", "request": { "method": "GET", "url": "{{baseUrl}}/admin/artists" } },
            { "name": "List artists (genre=rock)", "request": { "method": "GET", "url": "{{baseUrl}}/admin/artists?genre=rock" } },
            { "name": "Get artist", "request": { "method": "GET", "url": "{{baseUrl}}/admin/artists/{{artistIdInLineup}}" } },
            {
              "name": "Create artist",
              "request": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
                "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Artista Postman\",\n  \"genre\": \"jazz\"\n}" },
                "url": "{{baseUrl}}/admin/artists"
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "Update artist",
              "request": {
                "method": "PUT",
                "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
                "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Nombre actualizado\",\n  \"genre\": \"pop\"\n}" },
                "url": "{{baseUrl}}/admin/artists/{{artistIdInLineup}}"
              }
            },
            { "name": "Delete artist (sin historial)", "request": { "method": "DELETE", "url": "{{baseUrl}}/admin/artists/{{artistId}}" } }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Events",
          "item": [
            { "name": "List events", "request": { "method": "GET", "url": "{{baseUrl}}/admin/events" } },
            { "name": "List events (state=tentative)", "request": { "method": "GET", "url": "{{baseUrl}}/admin/events?state=tentative" } },
            { "name": "Get event by id", "request": { "method": "GET", "url": "{{baseUrl}}/admin/events/{{eventId}}" } },
            {
              "name": "Create event",
              "request": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
                "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Festival Demo\",\n  \"start_date\": \"2030-12-01T20:00:00\",\n  \"description\": \"Descripcion del evento\"\n}" },
                "url": "{{baseUrl}}/admin/events"
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "Update event (solo tentative)",
              "request": {
                "method": "PUT",
                "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
                "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Festival Demo (editado)\",\n  \"start_date\": \"2030-12-02T21:00:00\",\n  \"description\": \"Nueva descripcion\"\n}" },
                "url": "{{baseUrl}}/admin/events/{{eventId}}"
              }
            },
            { "name": "Delete event (solo tentative)", "request": { "method": "DELETE", "url": "{{baseUrl}}/admin/events/{{eventId}}" } },
            {
              "name": "Add artist to event",
              "request": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
                "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"artist_id\": {{artistId}}\n}" },
                "url": "{{baseUrl}}/admin/events/{{eventId}}/artists"
              }
            },
            { "name": "Remove artist from event", "request": { "method": "DELETE", "url": "{{baseUrl}}/admin/events/{{eventId}}/artists/{{artistIdInLineup}}" } },
            {
              "name": "Confirm event",
              "request": {
                "method": "PUT",
                "url": "{{baseUrl}}/admin/events/{{eventId}}/confirmed",
                "description": "Dispara notificaciones async a favoritos y followers."
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "Reschedule event",
              "request": {
                "method": "PUT",
                "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
                "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"start_date\": \"2031-01-15T22:00:00\"\n}" },
                "url": "{{baseUrl}}/admin/events/{{eventIdRescheduled}}/rescheduled"
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "Cancel event",
              "request": {
                "method": "PUT",
                "url": "{{baseUrl}}/admin/events/{{eventIdConfirmed}}/canceled",
                "description": "Usá evento 2 (confirmed). Dispara notificaciones."
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "TP4 — Flujo demo completo (en orden)",
      "description": "Ejecutá estos pasos en orden. Necesitás obtener token OAuth2 en las carpetas 2 y 3 antes de los pasos autenticados.\n\n| Paso | Carpeta | Request |\n|------|---------|--------|\n| 1 | 1 — Públicos | List active artists |\n| 2 | 1 — Públicos | Get tentative event (404) |\n| 3 | 2 — End-user | Follow artist |\n| 4 | 2 — End-user | Add favorite event |\n| 5 | 2 — End-user | Upcoming events from followed artists |\n| 6 | 3 — Admin | Cancel event |\n| 7 | 2 — End-user | List notifications |\n| 8 | 2 — End-user | Mark notification as read |",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Paso 1 — List active artists (público)",
          "request": { "method": "GET", "url": "{{baseUrl}}/artists", "auth": { "type": "noauth" } }
        },
        {
          "name": "Paso 2 — Tentative = 404 (público)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": ["pm.test('404', () => pm.response.to.have.status(404));"],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": { "method": "GET", "url": "{{baseUrl}}/events/1", "auth": { "type": "noauth" } }
        },
        {
          "name": "Paso 3 — Follow artist (tp4-user)",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "oauth2",
              "oauth2": [
                { "key": "grant_type", "value": "authorization_code", "type": "string" },
                { "key": "callbackUrl", "value": "{{callbackUrl}}", "type": "string" },
                { "key": "authUrl", "value": "{{keycloakAuthUrl}}", "type": "string" },
                { "key": "accessTokenUrl", "value": "{{keycloakTokenUrl}}", "type": "string" },
                { "key": "clientId", "value": "{{keycloakClientId}}", "type": "string" },
                { "key": "clientSecret", "value": "{{keycloakClientSecret}}", "type": "string" },
                { "key": "scope", "value": "openid", "type": "string" },
                { "key": "client_authentication", "value": "body", "type": "string" }
              ]
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"artist_id\": 1\n}" },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/me/following"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Paso 4 — Add favorite event 2 (tp4-user)",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "oauth2",
              "oauth2": [
                { "key": "grant_type", "value": "authorization_code", "type": "string" },
                { "key": "callbackUrl", "value": "{{callbackUrl}}", "type": "string" },
                { "key": "authUrl", "value": "{{keycloakAuthUrl}}", "type": "string" },
                { "key": "accessTokenUrl", "value": "{{keycloakTokenUrl}}", "type": "string" },
                { "key": "clientId", "value": "{{keycloakClientId}}", "type": "string" },
                { "key": "clientSecret", "value": "{{keycloakClientSecret}}", "type": "string" },
                { "key": "scope", "value": "openid", "type": "string" },
                { "key": "client_authentication", "value": "body", "type": "string" }
              ]
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"event_id\": 2\n}" },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/me/favorite-events"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Paso 5 — Events de artistas seguidos (tp4-user)",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "oauth2",
              "oauth2": [
                { "key": "grant_type", "value": "authorization_code", "type": "string" },
                { "key": "callbackUrl", "value": "{{callbackUrl}}", "type": "string" },
                { "key": "authUrl", "value": "{{keycloakAuthUrl}}", "type": "string" },
                { "key": "accessTokenUrl", "value": "{{keycloakTokenUrl}}", "type": "string" },
                { "key": "clientId", "value": "{{keycloakClientId}}", "type": "string" },
                { "key": "clientSecret", "value": "{{keycloakClientSecret}}", "type": "string" },
                { "key": "scope", "value": "openid", "type": "string" },
                { "key": "client_authentication", "value": "body", "type": "string" }
              ]
            },
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/me/following/events"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Paso 6 — Cancel event 2 (tp3-user admin)",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "oauth2",
              "oauth2": [
                { "key": "grant_type", "value": "authorization_code", "type": "string" },
                { "key": "callbackUrl", "value": "{{callbackUrl}}", "type": "string" },
                { "key": "authUrl", "value": "{{keycloakAuthUrl}}", "type": "string" },
                { "key": "accessTokenUrl", "value": "{{keycloakTokenUrl}}", "type": "string" },
                { "key": "clientId", "value": "{{keycloakClientId}}", "type": "string" },
                { "key": "clientSecret", "value": "{{keycloakClientSecret}}", "type": "string" },
                { "key": "scope", "value": "openid", "type": "string" },
                { "key": "client_authentication", "value": "body", "type": "string" }
              ]
            },
            "method": "PUT",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/admin/events/2/canceled",
            "description": "Obtené token admin (tp3-user) antes de ejecutar. Esperá 1-2 segundos para que se procesen las notificaciones async."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Paso 7 — List notifications (tp4-user)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Hay notificaciones', () => {",
                  "  const data = pm.response.json();",
                  "  pm.expect(data.length).to.be.above(0);",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('notificationId', String(data[0].id));",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "oauth2",
              "oauth2": [
                { "key": "grant_type", "value": "authorization_code", "type": "string" },
                { "key": "callbackUrl", "value": "{{callbackUrl}}", "type": "string" },
                { "key": "authUrl", "value": "{{keycloakAuthUrl}}", "type": "string" },
                { "key": "accessTokenUrl", "value": "{{keycloakTokenUrl}}", "type": "string" },
                { "key": "clientId", "value": "{{keycloakClientId}}", "type": "string" },
                { "key": "clientSecret", "value": "{{keycloakClientSecret}}", "type": "string" },
                { "key": "scope", "value": "openid", "type": "string" },
                { "key": "client_authentication", "value": "body", "type": "string" }
              ]
            },
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/me/notifications"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Paso 8 — Mark notification read (tp4-user)",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "oauth2",
              "oauth2": [
                { "key": "grant_type", "value": "authorization_code", "type": "string" },
                { "key": "callbackUrl", "value": "{{callbackUrl}}", "type": "string" },
                { "key": "authUrl", "value": "{{keycloakAuthUrl}}", "type": "string" },
                { "key": "accessTokenUrl", "value": "{{keycloakTokenUrl}}", "type": "string" },
